Remove the pass-uniffi-bindgen crate from the workspace default-members.

Since 2.5.0 the workspace Cargo.toml lists "pass-uniffi-bindgen" in
`default-members`, but that crate is not shipped in the source tarball
(it is only needed by maturin to generate the Python bindings), so cargo
refuses to build with:

    error: package `.../src/pass-uniffi-bindgen` is listed in
    default-members but is not a member for workspace

The crate is irrelevant for the CLI binary, so drop it from the list.

--- a/Cargo.toml
+++ b/Cargo.toml
@@ -8,8 +8,6 @@
     "pass-fs",
     "pass",
     "pass-derive",
-    # maturin runs its `uniffi-bindgen` bin (in the default members) to generate the Python bindings
-    "pass-uniffi-bindgen"
 ]
 resolver = "2"
 
